<title>JAPAN: MITI sees Oct-Dec steel output at 24.9 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>MITI sees Oct-Dec steel output at 24.9 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's crude steel output in the October-December period is expected to be 24.9 million tonnes, up 0.4 percent from a year earlier, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The ministry also said the third-quarter production would rise 3.0 percent from the output of 24.2 million tonnes expected in the July-September period.</p>
</text>
